			   scoped <style> here would silently fail to match any of the
			   JS-built markup (which is exactly what happened before this was
			   marked is:global: everything rendered as unstyled stacked text).
			   Safe to make global since this stylesheet only loads on this
			   page — admin-* classnames are specific enough not to collide
			   with anything else, but stay wary of adding a bare/short
			   classname here that other admin pages might also use. */
